    "Task journal unavailable": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Task journal unavailable"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Journal des tâches indisponible"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任务日志不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Homeport service on %@ stops and starts again, then its health is checked. Whatever it serves is briefly unavailable.": {
      "comment": "Consequence line of the Restart confirmation sheet.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Homeport service on %@ stops and starts again, then its health is checked. Whatever it serves is briefly unavailable."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le service Homeport de %@ s’arrête puis redémarre, et sa santé est vérifiée. Ce qu’il sert devient brièvement indisponible."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 上的 Homeport 服务将停止并重新启动，然后检查其健康状态。其所服务的内容将短暂不可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The control center reads your fleet from this file. Declare a first machine and it shows up here, with its own colour.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The control center reads your fleet from this file. Declare a first machine and it shows up here, with its own colour."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le centre de contrôle lit votre flotte dans ce fichier. Déclarez une première machine et elle apparaît ici, avec sa propre couleur."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "控制中心从此文件读取你的机群。声明第一台机器后，它就会带着自己的颜色出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dashboard of %@ did not respond. Check that Homeport is running, then retry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The dashboard of %@ did not respond. Check that Homeport is running, then retry."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le tableau de bord de %@ n'a pas répondu. Vérifiez que Homeport tourne, puis réessayez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的仪表盘未响应。请检查 Homeport 是否在运行，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The embedded terminal arrives with story 3.4, the embedded shell.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The embedded terminal arrives with story 3.4, the embedded shell."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le terminal intégré arrive avec la story 3.4, shell intégré."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内嵌终端将随故事 3.4（内嵌 Shell）一起提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The event history of this machine started a new generation — it is shown from the beginning.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The event history of this machine started a new generation — it is shown from the beginning."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'historique des événements de cette machine a démarré une nouvelle génération — il est affiché depuis le début."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此机器的事件历史记录已开始新一代 — 从头开始显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The event stream arrives with story 2.1, the v1 API contract and event stream.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The event stream arrives with story 2.1, the v1 API contract and event stream."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le flux d'événements arrive avec la story 2.1, contrat d'API v1 et flux d'événements."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "事件流将随故事 2.1（v1 API 契约与事件流）一起提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The metric history of this machine started a new generation — the curves shown are the new one.": {
      "comment": "Generation-change note of the Metrics tab (§5/§7): a normal event in a machine's life, never an error.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The metric history of this machine started a new generation — the curves shown are the new one."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'historique de métriques de cette machine a changé de génération — les courbes affichées sont celles de la nouvelle."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该机器的指标历史已进入新一代 — 所显示的曲线属于新一代。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most recent local backup replaces the current config and data of %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The most recent local backup replaces the current config and data of %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La sauvegarde locale la plus récente remplace la configuration et les données actuelles de %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近的本地备份将替换 %@ 当前的配置和数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service journal of %@ has nothing to show yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The service journal of %@ has nothing to show yet."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le journal du service de %@ n’a encore rien à afficher."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的服务日志暂无内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The task journal could not be opened — actions still run normally, they just leave no trace here. Check the file below, then relaunch the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The task journal could not be opened — actions still run normally, they just leave no trace here. Check the file below, then relaunch the app."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le journal des tâches n'a pas pu être ouvert — les actions s'exécutent normalement, elles ne laissent simplement aucune trace ici. Vérifiez le fichier ci-dessous, puis relancez l'application."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法打开任务日志——操作仍会正常执行，只是不会在此留下任何记录。请检查下方文件，然后重新启动应用程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This machine has not recorded any metrics yet. They appear here as its Homeport samples them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
